{
  "story": "Can a perfect training fit still overfit? Split labeled examples into equal folds. Refit simple and flexible models on the training folds, then test the untouched fold. Repeat with each fold held out. Compare training and cross-validation errors using identical splits.",
  "aha": {
    "stateId": "cv-comparison",
    "observation": "The flexible model fits training perfectly but performs worse on held-out examples, exposing overfitting across identical splits."
  },
  "layout": {
    "preset": "stepper-states",
    "width": 640
